{"id":18437,"date":"2023-10-29T23:40:28","date_gmt":"2023-10-29T23:40:28","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/?page_id=18437"},"modified":"2023-10-29T23:40:38","modified_gmt":"2023-10-29T23:40:38","slug":"casen-a","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/our-professional-djs\/casen-a\/","title":{"rendered":"Casen A."},"content":{"rendered":"<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft size-thumbnail wp-image-18438\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/IMG_1036-300x300.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" \/>Meet the maestro of melodies, DJ Casen, hailing from the picturesque Blue Ridge, GA. Music is in his DNA, as he follows in the footsteps of a family of DJs. In fact, his Dad still spins the tunes, passing the rhythm torch to the next generation.<\/p>\n<p>But DJ Casen is no ordinary music enthusiast. He&#8217;s a student at KSU, Georgia, juggling academics and a passion for hosting diverse events. From electrifying trivia nights to soulful jam sessions, Casen knows how to keep the groove going.<\/p>\n<p>At KSU, he&#8217;s not just a student; he&#8217;s a Jazz performance prodigy. As a freelance musician, percussionist, composer, and pianist, he crafts symphonies that touch the soul. His musical tastes are as eclectic as his talents \u2013 from the hard-hitting metal to the soothing rhythms of lo-fi hip hop, you&#8217;ll find it all in Casen&#8217;s headphones.<\/p>\n<p>Casen lives by the wise words of Louis Armstrong: &#8220;When music is good, it&#8217;s good.&#8221; Genre boundaries can&#8217;t contain his love for great music.<\/p>\n<p>What sets Casen apart is his youthful exuberance and raw energy. He&#8217;s a musical chameleon who can adapt to any audience, reading the room&#8217;s vibes and choosing the perfect tracks to keep the flow going. His ability to connect with the crowd is nothing short of magical.<\/p>\n<p>So, whether you&#8217;re craving a jazz sympho